This is repo with implementation of basic quantum state tomography to track density matrix evolution and estimate Lindbladian paramaters using Neural Networks.

LinbladianEvolutionOld contains different numerical methods of density matrix evolution
LindbladianEvolution_Jagoda contains codes for generating and loading density matrix evolution trajectiories created by Jagoda Zawisz
OdraQST contains codes for quantum state tomography
PINN contains NN learing evolution of density matrix
ParFindMLP_Maria contains NN used to estimate Lindbladian paramaters with density matrix snapshots created by Maria Hadam
